ref=\"/component/monitor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Monitor</a>, designed specifically for developers, programmers, and professionals who need precision, comfort, and productivity in one display. With a high-resolution 2560 x 1600 (WQXGA) panel and a 16:10 aspect ratio, this monitor offers 11% more vertical screen space than standard 16:9 monitors—perfect for reading long code files, comparing documents, or multitasking efficiently.</p><p><br></p><p><b>High Resolution 2K+ WQXGA (2560x1600)</b></p><p>Sharp, crisp visuals ideal for programming, UI/UX design, and content editing.</p><p><b>24.1” IPS Display with 16:10 Aspect Ratio</b></p><p>More vertical space means less scrolling when coding or reading documentation.</p><p><b>95% DCI-P3 Color Gamut + HDR10 Support</b></p><p>Vivid, color-accurate display for creative professionals and developers alike.</p><p><b>Dedicated Coding Modes</b></p><p>Optimized for readability with enhanced contrast for syntax highlighting.</p><p><b>USB-C Port with 90W Power Delivery</b></p><p>Connect and charge your laptop or MacBook with a single cable.</p><p><b>Multiple Connectivity Options</b></p><p>Includes HDMI 2.0, DisplayPort 1.4, 3x USB 3.2, and audio output for full flexibility.</p><p><b>Ergonomic Stand</b></p><p>Height, tilt, swivel, and pivot adjustments for ideal posture and long-hour comfort.</p><p><b>Eye-Care Technology</b></p><p>Features Low Blue Light, Flicker-Free, and Brightness Intelligence Gen2 to reduce eye strain.</p><p><b>Eco-Friendly Build</b></p><p>Made from 85% post-consumer recycled plastics and shipped in sustainable packaging.</p><p><br></p><h3>Why Choose BenQ RD240Q?</h3><h4>This monitor is ideal for:</h4><ul><li>Software developers &amp; programmers</li><li>IT professionals and system administrators</li><li>Designers who need vertical screen space</li><li>Remote workers looking for ergonomic setups</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n            